											"uidString" : "VD9MXtFsQ622Zwr0FItPMQ=="
										},
										"paragraphStyle" : {
											"__type" : "textStyle"
										},
										"string" : "4. **View Data** (subclass of {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowBasicViewData}}) — a value object carrying the computed data (e.g., bytes, dimensions). Serializes to/from dictionaries for transport."
									},
