							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "A local/remote view consists of several collaborating classes:"
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-01T13:15:19.947779+02:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-01T15:17:08.500712+02:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "SFplzOVrQBGKHZAQMMPvWQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "For views that just need to pass a single data object around use {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowPictureView}}  as a starting example. For these views,  {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowConcreteDataViewSpecification}} and the generic data source {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowConcreteDataViewDataSource}} are sufficient. The application defines only the view by subclassing {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowLocalView}}, its {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowBasicViewData}} subclass, and its rendering stencil(s). "
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-01T13:15:23.751139+02:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-01T13:15:23.751139+02:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "b96KwQNiSN+R5Ac0DiteKg=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Define an application-specific specification/datasource pair only if generic concrete-data retrieval is insufficient. {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowWebBrowserView}} is that advanced example."
						}
					]
				},
