							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "A view specification is a serializable description of a Phlow view: it carries the view’s title, priority, actions, transport configuration, and any data needed to reconstruct and render it in another place. It creates the local explicit view—typically with a declarative stencil—and coordinates retrieving or holding the concrete view data. "
						},
