							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "For a fixed rendering contract, a dedicated stencil subclassing {{gtClass:GtPhlowStencil}} is appropriate. {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowWebBrowserStencil}} demonstrates this. It owns only concrete serializable values, implements {{gtMethod:GtRemotePhlowWebBrowserStencil>>#asDictionaryForExport|label=#selector}} and {{gtMethod:GtRemotePhlowWebBrowserStencil>>#initializeFromJSONDictionary:|label=#selector}}, and inherits {{gtMethod:GtPhlowStencil>>#asGtStencilSpecification}}. Its standalone API accepts concrete values, never closures."
						}
					]
				},
