							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "For views to work across GemStone, a client-side proxy class is needed (subclass of {{gtClass:GtpoGtPhlowViewSpecification}}). The proxy lives in the package {{gtPackage:GToolkit-GemStone-Pharo}} in the `Proxies` tag."
						},
