								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "For a new local/remote view that computes one custom serializable value, start with the generic concrete-data pipeline. This is now the main and simplest approach. {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowPictureView}} is the reference implementation."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
