										"string" : "1. a view subclass of {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowLocalView}} that owns computation blocks and implements `computeViewData`;\n2. a serializable view-data value subclass of {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowBasicViewData}};\n3. a declarative rendering stencil, normally selected by name."
