								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The picture view's `computeViewData` answers {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowPictureViewData}}, which carries picture bytes, media type, width, and height. Its configured rendering-stencil name is turned into a {{gtClass:GtPhlowNamedStencil}} by {{gtMethod:GtRemotePhlowConcreteDataViewSpecification>>#createDeclarativeStencilForViewData:}}."
						},
