								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-01T15:40:56.928465+02:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "L4VGG49RRtK7pIxEi6A2ow=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The dedicated browser stencil subclasses {{gtClass:GtPhlowStencil}}, exports its concrete state with {{gtMethod:GtRemotePhlowWebBrowserStencil>>#asDictionaryForExport}}, and restores it with {{gtMethod:GtRemotePhlowWebBrowserStencil>>#initializeFromJSONDictionary:}}. It inherits {{gtMethod:GtPhlowStencil>>#asGtStencilSpecification}}, which creates a {{gtClass:GtRemotePhlowDirectStencilSpecification}}; do not add a redundant stencil-specification class."
						},
